{"id":482,"title":"解答: 埃及分数","summary":"详细分析了如何将分数转换为一系列埃及分数。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c22c2dcb-0357-4639-9f60-4ef684222af7","text":"## 参考答案","text_html":"<h2>参考答案</h2>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"TabbedCode","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f024c263-2d71-40a1-94cb-c12318dd597a","caption":"","code_contents":[{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_0_f024c263-2d71-40a1-94cb-c12318dd597a","title":"egyptain_fraction","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"import math\n\ndef egyptian_fraction(numerator, denominator):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the egyptian fraction denominators\n    :param numerator: Numerator of the fraction\n    :param denominator: Denominator of the fraction\n    :return: A list of denominators of the egyptian fraction\n    \"\"\"\n\n    # A List to store denominator\n    lst_denominator = []\n\n    # While loop runs until fraction becomes 0 i.e,\n    # numerator becomes 0\n    while numerator != 0:\n        # taking ceiling\n        x = math.ceil(denominator / numerator)\n\n        # storing value in lst_denominator list\n        lst_denominator.append(x)\n\n        # updating new numerator and denominator\n        numerator = x * numerator - denominator\n        denominator = denominator * x\n\n    return lst_denominator\n\n\n# Driver code to test above function\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n\n    print(egyptian_fraction(6, 14))\n    print(egyptian_fraction(2, 3))\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null}],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a5091569-d529-4ce6-88ad-35c4251ac8dd","text":"### 解释\n\n使用贪心算法寻找埃及分数。 对于形式为`n/d`的分数，其中`d > n`，找到最大可能的单位分数，然后对剩余部分执行递归。\n\n例如，考虑 $6/14$。 首先找到$\\lceil 14/6 \\rceil$的上限，即$3$，所以第一个单位分数变成$1/3$。 现在从 $6/14$ 中减去 $1/3$，然后重复寻找 $(6/14$ $–$ $1/3)$的埃及分数，即 $4/42$。\n\n### 时间复杂度\n\n时间复杂度为 $O(log n)$，因为分数总是被简化为分母大于分子且分子不除以分母的形式。","text_html":"<h3>解释</h3>\n<p>使用贪心算法寻找埃及分数。 对于形式为<code>n/d</code>的分数，其中<code>d &gt; n</code>，找到最大可能的单位分数，然后对剩余部分执行递归。</p>\n<p>例如，考虑 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6/14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span></span></span></span>。 首先找到<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>⌈</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>6</mn><mo>⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil 14/6 \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">6</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span>的上限，即<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span></span></span></span>，所以第一个单位分数变成<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span></span></span></span>。 现在从 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6/14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span></span></span></span> 中减去 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span></span></span></span>，然后重复寻找 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(6/14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span></span></span></span> – <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>的埃及分数，即 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4/42</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3>时间复杂度</h3>\n<p>时间复杂度为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>，因为分数总是被简化为分母大于分子且分子不除以分母的形式。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"1961ff0a-fdff-4e3b-a834-4cb8489a295e","text":"---\n\n让我们继续迎接下一个挑战。","text_html":"<hr />\n<p>让我们继续迎接下一个挑战。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":3}],"status":"undo","course_no":"010","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/010/page/482"}
